    "description": "Natural Specimens\nPolished Fluorite Heart and Raw Stone Collection\nMineral, Stone, and Seashell Set\nApprox. 1\" to 1.75\" Dimensions\nUnsigned\nThis eclectic collection features four distinct natural elements, headlined by a hand-polished green and blue fluorite heart. The fluorite exhibits characteristic translucency and internal crystalline structures typical of the mineral. Accompanying the heart is a weathered river stone with a smooth, water-worn texture, a raw mineral specimen with granular surface detail, and a naturally aged bivalve seashell with distinct ribbing and radial symmetry.\nPolished fluorite heart displays vibrant shades of teal and forest green\nRough mineral specimen features crystalline inclusions and earthy tones\nNatural bivalve seashell shows classic radial symmetry and weathered white finish\nCondition:\nExcellent natural condition. The fluorite heart is polished to a high gloss with minor internal fissures typical of the mineral. The raw stones and shell show natural textures, weathering, and geological characteristics consistent with their natural and geological origins.\nMerchandise is sold As Is. Returns will only be accepted with prior authorization and under the terms stated in this Return Policy. If you have questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item please contact Goodwill of Silicon Valley at 408-869-9262 prior to placing your bid. Items may be returned within seven (7) days of receipt if the merchandise was damaged during shipping or if there was a major distortion in the description. Returns will not be accepted without prior authorization. PLEASE NOTE THAT WE DO NOT REFUND SHIPPING AND HANDLING\nCHARGES. Items selected for pick up from the seller, must be picked up within thirty (30) days from close of auction. Items not picked up from seller within thirty (30) days from close of auction will be resold with no further\nnotice.\nLocal Pickup Policy\nAll items must be picked up within 30 days of purchase.\nAny item not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be resold without any prior notification.\nAll items picked up must be picked up by the individual named in the profile.\nNo 3rd party pickups without prior approval.\nIdentification is required to be shown when picking up all orders\nPayment for items not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be refunded automatically.\nAll pick-up orders must be paid for prior to pick-up. Payments will not be accepted on-site - no exceptions.\nNo Walk-Ins.\nIf you have not scheduled and received a confirmation of your pick up time, we will not be able to accommodate your pick up. Local pickup must be scheduled prior to arrival by calling Customer Service at 408-869-9262.\nThe pickup address for all items is 1600 Technology Drive, San Jose, CA 95110\nLocal pickup is available by appointment only and must be picked up within 30 days.",
